      "text": "**Initiating Active Communication**\n\nI\u0027m now focusing on a plan to actively communicate with associates. My idea involves leveraging a Chrome extension, perhaps \"Wapook\" or something comparable like \"Booksender,\" to send bulk messages. I\u0027m aiming to integrate this with a Customer Relationship Management (CRM) or Customer Success approach, and data collection will be critical for assessing impact.\n\n\n**Refining Data Collection**\n\nI\u0027m now refining the data collection approach. I\u0027ve realized Google Forms has limitations with editing responses, so a manual clean-up process will be needed. The process is now clarified: associates sign up on a Google Form, choosing their interests. I\u0027ll filter the list, grab the numbers, and then send the message with a Chrome extension like Wapook, aiming for efficiency over broadcast lists.\n\n\n**Structuring the Action Plan**\n\nI\u0027ve broken down the project into distinct phases: Setup, Data Capture, and Spreadsheet Logic. Phase 1 focuses on installing a Chrome extension (like Wapook or Booksender) and setting up a dedicated computer. Phase 2 involves creating a Google Form to gather associate data, including their names, company, and interests. I need to be sure to make the WhatsApp number mandatory.\n\n\n",
